WEBVTT

00:05:29.079 --> 00:05:31.038
People apologize for less.

00:05:31.871 --> 00:05:33.704
And so I got a cop to confirm

00:05:33.746 --> 00:05:36.621
that Abed still lived somewhere
in the same town,

00:05:36.621 --> 00:05:37.913
and I was now driving to it

00:05:37.954 --> 00:05:39.996
with a potted yellow rose
in the back seat,

00:05:39.996 --> 00:05:43.246
when suddenly flowers
seemed a ridiculous offering.

00:05:43.996 --> 00:05:46.829
But what to get the man
who broke your fucking neck?

00:05:47.163 --> 00:05:51.246
(Laughter)

00:05:51.788 --> 00:05:53.538
I pulled into the town of Abu Ghosh,

00:05:53.538 --> 00:05:55.371
and bought a brick of Turkish delight:

00:05:55.413 --> 00:05:57.413
pistachios glued in rosewater.

00:05:57.788 --> 00:05:58.954
Better.